@page "/about"

<PageTitle>About Lucky Stars Chess Club</PageTitle>

<div class="page-header">
    <div class="page-header-icon">⭐♟️</div>

    <h1>About Lucky Stars Chess Club</h1>

    <p>Checkmate the Odds</p>
</div>

<section class="about-section">

    <h2>Who We Are</h2>

    <p>
        Lucky Stars Chess Club is a community built around
        the game of chess. We welcome players who want to
        learn, improve, compete, and enjoy chess with others.
    </p>

    <p>
        Whether you are making your first moves or already
        competing at a high level, our goal is to provide
        an environment where every player can develop their
        skills and confidence.
    </p>

</section>

<section class="about-section">

    <h2>Our Mission</h2>

    <p>
        Our mission is to promote chess, develop young and
        aspiring players, encourage sportsmanship, and create
        opportunities for our members to compete and grow.
    </p>

</section>

<section class="values-section">

    <h2>What We Believe In</h2>

    <div class="values">

        <div class="value-card">
            <div class="value-icon">🧠</div>
            <h3>Learning</h3>
            <p>
                Every game is an opportunity to learn something new.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="value-card">
            <div class="value-icon">🤝</div>
            <h3>Community</h3>
            <p>
                We believe chess is better when players learn
                and grow together.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="value-card">
            <div class="value-icon">🏆</div>
            <h3>Excellence</h3>
            <p>
                We encourage discipline, dedication, and
                continuous improvement.
            </p>
        </div>

    </div>

</section>